 clickbaiting and false advertising.  let's get to the actual important part, shall we?\n\n\nFeatures:\nCentered: The core part, and purpose of this test, is to test the true capability of the executor you're using, so that's why I've decided to make the loadstring function the core part of this test (meaning there will be a lot more information about the loadstring function than the original UNC test provides. This is mainly because loadstring is used in almost all scripts that you may want to use.\n\nInformation: When a function, or more fail, they will ALSO be displayed separately, showing the reason why each function failed\n\nLiars: In addition to the feature above, executors who try to fake the respective function will have a custom clowning message directed towards the developers and owner(s) of the executor. Some exploits trigger this feature: BanEveryoneMantiWPF, Ratsolora, and BanwaveCelery.\n\nExecutor's capability: At the end of the test, you will be able to see how much time the executor took to complete the test. And the better the executor is, the faster it will be. Below, a small rating will be given to the executor.\n\n\nUsage (how?):\nSimply get into any Roblox place, inject the exploit you want, and execute the script. If you encounter bugs, please read below.\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTE!\nI strongly recommend, and encourage you to share this to get rid of exploit owners who lie to their community, and promote false advertising.","tags":["fake executors","executor","hacks","hack","roblox"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66a1370183dcf0538abc831e","username":"derek197895","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b368dca27c735f2a76a44aeeb433ee0fe4b0cfe241166e8a935ad133ba02e739.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a1370183dcf0538abc831e-1724397897032.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66a1370183dcf0538abc831e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b368